  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida ger st&#xF6;d till Islamic Relief i tv&#xE5; projekt: 1) Kontantst&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r arbete d&#xE4;r m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att skapa arbetstillf&#xE4;llen och d&#xE4;rmed en s&#xE4;krare livsmedelssituation f&#xF6;r 500 familjer i Gaza. 2) Matbist&#xE5;nd i 8 m&#xE5;nader till 3000 familjer i utsatta situationer i Gaza.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is suopporting two projects: 1. Cash for work for unemployed workers with the objective to provide employment opportunities for six months for around 500 (males &amp; females) in Gaza. Results is reduced unemployment. 2. Food assistanceto contribute in alleviating suffering of 3000 families. Result families to receive food for 8 months.</narrative>
